flowchart TD
  Operator[Operator UI / CLI] --> Switch[Shared mode-switch service]
  Future[Future traffic/load controller] -.-> Switch
  Switch --> Writer[Atomic .htaccess writer]
  Writer --> Mode{Applied mode}
  Request[Page request] --> Mode
  Mode -->|Normal| PHP[Normal PHP routing]
  Mode -->|High traffic| Eligible{Eligible public request?}
  Eligible -->|No| PHP
  Eligible -->|Yes, including sessions| Cached{Cached HTML exists?}
  Cached -->|Yes| Apache[Apache serves HTML]
  Cached -->|No| Capacity{Generation capacity available?}
  Capacity -->|No| Busy[Temporary unavailable + retry guidance]
  Capacity -->|Yes| Generate[Coordinated shared-page generation]
  Log[Latest X access.log lines] --> Rank[Rank eligible pages by popularity]
  Rank --> Cron[Bounded cron refresh]
  Cron --> Generate
  Apache --> Timestamp[Check embedded generation timestamp]
  Timestamp -->|Stale| Low[Validated low-priority refresh request]
  Low --> Cron
  Generate --> Temp[Render temporary HTML]
  Temp --> Valid{Still eligible and current?}
  Valid -->|Yes| Publish[Atomically replace cached HTML]
  Valid -->|No| Discard[Discard obsolete result]
  Publish --> Cache[(HTML cache)]
  Cache --> Cached
  Generate -->|Refresh fails| Keep[Keep existing eligible HTML; record failure]
